/-!
# Rational tails and global generation of `ω_{X/S}^{⊗ m}` (Stacks 0E6Y)

Let `f : X → S` be a prestable family of curves of genus `g ≥ 1`, with relative dualizing complex
`ω^•_{X/S}` (Stacks 0E5X) and relative dualizing sheaf `ω_{X/S} = H^{-1}(ω^•_{X/S})`
(Stacks 0E6Q). For a point `s ∈ S` and `m ≥ 2`, the fibre `X_s` has no rational tail exactly when
`f^*f_*ω_{X/S}^{⊗ m} ⟶ ω_{X/S}^{⊗ m}` is surjective over `f⁻¹(U)` for some open `U ∋ s`
(Stacks 0E6Y).

## Main results

* `AlgebraicGeometry.CurveFamily.hasNoRationalTailFibre_iff_isCounitSurjectiveAbove`: for
  `m ≥ 2`, the fibre `X_s` has no rational tail if and only if the counit
  `f^*f_*ω_{X/S}^{⊗ m} ⟶ ω_{X/S}^{⊗ m}` is surjective over `f⁻¹(U)` for some open `U ∋ s`.
* `C1764Prereq.isGeneratedByGlobalSections_and_isZero_cohomology_one_of_two_le_genus`: over a
  field, for a nodal curve of genus `g ≥ 2` without rational tails and `m ≥ 2`, `ω^{⊗ m}` is
  globally generated with vanishing `H¹`.
* `C1764Prereq.forall_not_isRationalTail_of_isGeneratedByGlobalSections`: over a field, a nodal
  curve with a globally generated power `ω^{⊗ m}`, `m ≥ 1`, has no rational tail.

## Implementation notes

The point `s` is read through the residue field point `Spec κ(s) ⟶ S`, and the fibre `X_s`, a
priori an algebraic space, through a scheme presenting it, as in
`AlgebraicGeometry.CurveFamily.HasNoRationalTailFibre`. The relative dualizing complex is an
argument (`AlgebraicGeometry.CurveFamily.dualizingSheafOfComplex`); its invertibility, needed to
form the tensor powers, is `AlgebraicGeometry.CurveFamily.isInvertible_dualizingSheafOfComplex`
(Stacks 0E6R). The family is of genus `g` in the sense of part (1)(b) of Stacks 0E6V: `R¹f_*𝒪_X`
is finite locally free of rank `g`.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 0E6Y](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0E6Y)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0E6Q](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0E6Q)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0E3K](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0E3K)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0E63](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0E63)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0CTM](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0CTM)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0E6A](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0E6A)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

